 "captions": [
  {
   "t0": 0.17,
   "t1": 2.5,
   "text": "A distance no moon survives",
   "line": "ch8_hook"
  },
  {
   "t0": 3.394,
   "t1": 5.974,
   "text": "Thirty-five thousand kilometers.",
   "line": "ch8_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 5.994,
   "t1": 6.034,
   "text": "Thirty thousand.",
   "line": "ch8_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 6.054,
   "t1": 8.359,
   "text": "Twenty-five.",
   "line": "ch8_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 8.379,
   "t1": 9.479,
   "text": "Twenty.",
   "line": "ch8_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 9.499,
   "t1": 12.005,
   "text": "There is a distance where tides pull harder",
   "line": "ch8_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 12.025,
   "t1": 14.904,
   "text": "on a body than its own gravity holds it together.",
   "line": "ch8_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 14.924,
   "t1": 17.009,
   "text": "It is called the Roche limit.",
   "line": "ch8_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 17.029,
   "t1": 20.883,
   "text": "For a Moon like ours around Earth, it is around eighteen",
   "line": "ch8_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 20.903,
   "t1": 24.639,
   "text": "thousand kilometers, if the Moon behaves like a fluid.",
   "line": "ch8_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 24.659,
   "t1": 28.424,
   "text": "Around nine and a half thousand, if it is perfectly rigid.",
   "line": "ch8_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 28.444,
   "t1": 31.539,
   "text": "A real Moon sits somewhere in between.",
   "line": "ch8_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 31.559,
   "t1": 34.016,
   "text": "At eighteen thousand kilometers, it looks",
   "line": "ch8_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 34.036,
   "t1": 36.574,
   "text": "more than twenty times wider than tonight.",
   "line": "ch8_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 36.594,
   "t1": 39.367,
   "text": "It is at least as wide as a fist held out",
   "line": "ch8_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 39.387,
   "t1": 42.249,
   "text": "at arm's length, and wider still overhead.",
   "line": "ch8_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 42.269,
   "t1": 44.564,
   "text": "It is not a Moon you look at any more.",
   "line": "ch8_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 44.584,
   "t1": 48.489,
   "text": "It is a wall of grey, and its surface is straining.",
   "line": "ch8_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 48.676,
   "t1": 51.791,
   "text": "If you want one more orbit, tap like and follow.",
   "line": "cta4_follow"
  },
  {
   "t0": 51.916,
   "t1": 53.256,
   "text": "Eighteen thousand.",
   "line": "ch8_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 53.276,
   "t1": 54.536,
   "text": "Seventeen.",
   "line": "ch8_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 54.556,
   "t1": 56.401,
   "text": "The tide is enormous.",
   "line": "ch8_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 56.649,
   "t1": 59.924,
   "text": "And then the Moon does something no Moon should survive.",
   "line": "ch8_loop"
  },
  {
   "t0": 60.106,
   "t1": 61.201,
   "text": "Part eight of eight.",
